To replace the Boost.Multi subtree with the v0.91.1 tag, run these commands from the top-level QMCPACK source directory. This overwrites the existing vendored copy.

git merge --abort  # only if a previous subtree merge is in progress
git rm -r external_codes/boost_multi/multi
git commit -m "Remove old boost-multi subtree"
git subtree add --squash -P external_codes/boost_multi/multi https://gitlab.com/correaa/boost-multi.git v0.91.1
